{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20092","headline":"送卢虔端公守复州 · 孟郊","name":"送卢虔端公守复州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师旷听羣木，自然识孤桐。\n正声逢知音，愿出大朴中。\n知音不韵俗，独立占古风。\n忽挂触邪冠，逮逐南飞鸿。\n肃肃太守章，明明华毂熊。\n商山无平路，楚水有惊潨。\n日月千里外，光阴难载同。\n新愁徒自积，良会何由通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}